extends emailLayout

block content
  div(style="width: 100%") 
    h1(style="text-align: center") Reset password request
    p We received a request to reset the password for the Toolso account associated with this e-mail address. Click the link below to reset your password using our secure server:

    a(href=resetLink, style="margin:20px auto; width : 150px; color: #fff;background-color: #3c4b64;border-color: #3c4b64;display: block;font-weight: normal;text-align: center;white-space: nowrap;vertical-align: middle;user-select: none;border: 1px solid transparent;padding: 0.5rem 1rem;font-size: 0.875rem;line-height: 1.25;transition: all 0.2s ease-in-out;") Reset your password
    br
    p If you did not request to have your password reset, you can safely ignore this email.

